    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212680/extras/b6758efebf1907645c82b35313898510.avif?t=1754564112\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Evil Of Fate</strong> is a psychological horror and suspense-action game with co-op multiplayer first and third-person camera-based weapon mechanics. This story will draw you into its realistic and spooky dystopian world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212680/extras/53dfbf70ca2d10ab3365a316837e4048.webp?t=1754564112\" /></div><strong>It is about four faculty graduates searching for the missing female detective Carmen in the deserted forest. Detective Chris, whose car crashed, will fight against monsters, spiritual beings and demons in the forest with the remaining three women.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212680/extras/04eeb4cbf160702df814b34081e93a32.poster.avif?t=1754564112\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212680/extras/04eeb4cbf160702df814b34081e93a32.webm?t=1754564112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212680/extras/04eeb4cbf160702df814b34081e93a32.mp4?t=1754564112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212680/extras/3219d41294063d553cba7782d5830779.webp?t=1754564112\" /></div><strong>Defend yourself by applying weapon mechanics on your enemies rather than just a walking simulation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212680/extras/703f640f9291918c5fe6d1f3ad40a368.poster.avif?t=1754564112\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212680/extras/703f640f9291918c5fe6d1f3ad40a368.webm?t=1754564112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212680/extras/703f640f9291918c5fe6d1f3ad40a368.mp4?t=1754564112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212680/extras/fda36e545f3c2e39b31b866ff7dcbcb5.webp?t=1754564112\" /></div><strong>Multiplayer experience with high graphics and performance, including Hair Strand, developed with Unreal Engine 5 technology.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212680/extras/0c2e0e2269ee59956a28156c7098918e.poster.avif?t=1754564112\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212680/extras/0c2e0e2269ee59956a28156c7098918e.webm?t=1754564112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212680/extras/0c2e0e2269ee59956a28156c7098918e.mp4?t=1754564112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2212680/extras/c9b688a34e0f53cd05fdee955dd14a7e.webp?t=1754564112\" /></div><strong>Easy-to-use, advanced and high-end designed menus and 